{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-08-17 07:45:00', 'title': 'JACOBS WINS CONTRACT FOR THE US ARMY INTELLIGENCE AND SECURITY COMMAND', 'text': 'DALLAS, AUG. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JACOBS (NYSE:J) WAS AWARDED A TASK ORDER CONTRACT BY THE U.S. ARMY INTELLIGENCE AND SECURITY COMMAND (INSCOM) TO PROVIDE COUNTERINTELLIGENCE, COUNTERTERRORISM AND HUMAN INTELLIGENCE SUPPORT TO THE 902ND MILITARY INTELLIGENCE GROUP AT FORT MEADE, MARYLAND. THE CONTRACT HAS A VALUE OF $235 MILLION OVER A FIVE-YEAR PERIOD.'}